<title>BELGIUM: SOLVAY 1996 NET PROFIT 13.6 BLN BFR.</title>
<headline>SOLVAY 1996 NET PROFIT 13.6 BLN BFR.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in billion Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net (including minorities)    13.6   vs   12.5</p>
<p>    Group net before extraordinaries    11.5   vs   12.5</p>
<p>Current earnings/share (francs)</p>
<p>     (excluding minorities)		  1,326 vs  1,475</p>
<p>NOTE - Final 1996 results from Belgian chemicals group Solvay are due on March 27.  </p>
<p>    Group earnings/share (francs)	  1,577 vs  1,471</p>
<p>    Cons cashflow			     33.0   vs   30.8</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			    282.7   vs  273.4</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains			  2.1   vs   nil</p>
<p>    Depreciation				19.4   vs   18.3</p>
<p>NOTE - research and development expenditures 12.1 billion francs in 1997 from 12.3 billion in 1996.</p>
<p>Capital spending for 1997 28.0 billion francs compared to 28.0 billion in 1996.</p>
<p>Annual General shareholders meeting to be held on June 5.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
